{"title":"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Remark\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Remark</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(⚡️Lightning_Fast⚡️)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (⚡️Lightning Fast⚡️)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3_by_SpreadTheMathLove\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 3 by SpreadTheMathLove</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many three-digit positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/d/58d98ba0214a50d7d64ca253149208096064772c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\underline{a} \\ \\underline{b} \\ \\underline{c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> are there whose nonzero digits <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/b/f3b28547efd22be1c4a05fa193cd7038fc65d71b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"29\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> satisfy\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/4/9e448c87f48492e9f1518a6989dee06242cab99f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[0.\\overline{\\underline{a}~\\underline{b}~\\underline{c}} = \\frac{1}{3} (0.\\overline{a} + 0.\\overline{b} + 0.\\overline{c})?\\]\" width=\"221\" height=\"37\" />\n(The bar indicates repetition, thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0a175898592a6b763aac47c236314e5cc76d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.\\overline{\\underline{a}~\\underline{b}~\\underline{c}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"22\" /> is the infinite repeating decimal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/8/1588aaa4bdc902a1ff333d41541847c8094b4d8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.\\underline{a}~\\underline{b}~\\underline{c}~\\underline{a}~\\underline{b}~\\underline{c}~\\cdots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"127\" height=\"18\" />)\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/6/d16b9b030f8acde25e666be01a8e637e00c32527.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 9 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) } 10 \\qquad \\textbf{(C) } 11 \\qquad \\textbf{(D) } 13 \\qquad \\textbf{(E) } 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"392\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We rewrite the given equation, then rearrange:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/4/574485f1e449aad173c26ce9e276a358de6a3900.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\frac{100a+10b+c}{999} &amp;= \\frac13\\left(\\frac a9 + \\frac b9 + \\frac c9\\right) \\\\ 100a+10b+c &amp;= 37a + 37b + 37c \\\\ 63a &amp;= 27b+36c \\\\ 7a &amp;= 3b+4c. \\end{align*}\" width=\"265\" height=\"115\" />\nNow, this problem is equivalent to counting the ordered triples <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/d/f3d9e22097e20a1249b5332202b24941a4bf9e1f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"57\" height=\"20\" /> that satisfies the equation.\n</p><p>Clearly, the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> ordered triples <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/a/19ab2712d5be82676ba4bcfef68ef44dbf251593.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c)=(1,1,1),(2,2,2),\\ldots,(9,9,9)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"303\" height=\"20\" /> are solutions to this equation.\n</p><p>The expression <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/a/84afc4c65c21e035d649f26cb942959bf2d95d2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3b+4c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"58\" height=\"16\" /> has the same value when:\n</p>\n<ul><li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> increases by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> decreases by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/0/93032f1ab8b685d84a767a2fde0d9006a464b5e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3.$\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" /></li></ul>\n<ul><li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> decreases by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> increases by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/0/93032f1ab8b685d84a767a2fde0d9006a464b5e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3.$\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" /></li></ul>\n<p>We find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more solutions from the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> solutions above: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/1/4e1d8053d1bc2a5ed63bec2ab96159bc20305bdb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c)=(4,8,1),(5,1,8),(5,9,2),(6,2,9).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"341\" height=\"20\" /> Note that all solutions are symmetric about <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/f/81f2193c286d812dcf1dd9f45ed1e8d4b84f13cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c)=(5,5,5).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"144\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Together, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/a/faa6d7091d0e1036875520662bad98a814f8cc9e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9+4=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) } 13}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"132\" height=\"30\" /> ordered triples <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/e/e3e4ce6135f44658120400b12106ad7ced4cd72f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"62\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Remark\">Remark</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Remark\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>One way to solve the Diophantine Equation, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/4/984900ad1b00f693786400aa98c8bc3801766e21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7a=3b+4c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"101\" height=\"16\" /> is by taking <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/e/e2e9a092417fc5007f15fbeca7054c70cdbd1d2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pmod{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"70\" height=\"18\" />, from which the equation becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/1/2a11c8bd1f85f4dc9f0094f1e0d0b2289171268f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\equiv 3b-3c\\pmod{7} \\Longrightarrow b\\equiv c\\pmod{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"315\" height=\"20\" /> so either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/d/ebda5306c70a24c574ef0107ed5b5152b5f594cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=c$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" /> or WLOG <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/b/59bfcab3ad5760653d1b4311e78b0ad61758f2d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&lt;c, b+7=c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"121\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1\">Video Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/p6IauwE8cX8\">https://youtu.be/p6IauwE8cX8</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28.E2.9A.A1.EF.B8.8FLightning_Fast.E2.9A.A1.EF.B8.8F.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(⚡️Lightning_Fast⚡️)\">Video Solution (⚡️Lightning Fast⚡️)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (⚡️Lightning Fast⚡️)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/mgcHM0ATUks\">https://youtu.be/mgcHM0ATUks</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3\">Video Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YAazoVATYQA&amp;list=PLmpPPbOoDfgj5BlPtEAGcB7BR_UA5FgFj&amp;index=4\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YAazoVATYQA&amp;list=PLmpPPbOoDfgj5BlPtEAGcB7BR_UA5FgFj&amp;index=4</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3_by_SpreadTheMathLove\">Video Solution 3 by SpreadTheMathLove</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 3 by SpreadTheMathLove\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yLkGjQ-atzU&amp;list=PLmpPPbOoDfggaByZonvjv_0Wy7XftFA9L&amp;index=63\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yLkGjQ-atzU&amp;list=PLmpPPbOoDfggaByZonvjv_0Wy7XftFA9L&amp;index=63</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A\">2022 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_10_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 10 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 10 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017031237\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 265/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2324/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 158/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6011/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.646      1 -total\n 60.33%    7.630      1 Template:AMC10_box\n 38.69%    4.893      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:23294:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017031237 and revision id 289542. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}